  <compounddef id="fp16__vector__kernels_8h" kind="file" language="C++">
    <compoundname>fp16_vector_kernels.h</compoundname>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Declarations for FP16 and BF16 GPU vector distance kernel launchers. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>These functions are the C++ host-side launchers for the mixed-precision CUDA kernels implemented in <computeroutput>src/acceleration/cuda/fp16_vector_kernels.cu</computeroutput>. They accept FP32 host-layout pointers and return FP32 results; the precision reduction happens on-device inside the kernel.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Only available when <computeroutput>THEMIS_ENABLE_CUDA</computeroutput> is defined and the build includes the CUDA toolkit (nvcc ≥ 11.8).</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="version"><para>1.0.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Maturity: 🟢 PRODUCTION-READY </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
